    'Project onto a subspace, form the normal equations, and solve a small least-squares problem.',
    'Compute determinants of small matrices and use det as a volume/invertibility test.',
    'Find eigenvalues and eigenvectors of 2×2 (and simple 3×3) matrices and explain diagonalization when it exists.',
